    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Morrigan_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241111125513\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Morrigan \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"579\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Morrigan .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Morrigan_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Morrigan_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241111125513\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eQueen of The Nigth \u003c/b\u003e\nA beatiful succubus from one of the tree houses of the Darkrealm. She constantly leaves Aesland Castle in search of stimulus she can find back home to visit the human realm.realmente. Sheis known as a Darkstalker, creatures of the nigth who dwell in the Darkrealm.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Morrigan_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:74px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Morrigan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Morrigan Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (246 KB)\" style=\"height:18